{"_note":"观察记录卡(A 的版本档案 + B 的事件流在此合并):forEach 事件表 evList,按 evN 截断。三类事件按 t 数字码分支(1=发布·源色蓝 / 2=评分变动·琥珀 / 3=评分数里程碑·灰)—— eq 是数字化比较,数字码四端同判,字母码不行。卡高由数据层的 evH 决定(XPage 节点 h=${evH}pt,pill 首页同一手法)。空表渲「开始观察」引导 —— 首日事件表只有一条「发布 vX(首见)」甚至为空,诚实空态。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"bg","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"{parent.h}","bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_n","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${evN},0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[ge::(${_n},2)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"19pt","y":"24pt","w":"1pt","h":"{parent.h}-48pt","bgColor":"#E4E7EC|#262A31"}]},{"type":"op","action":"forEach","props":{"items":"${evList}","key":"_e","index":"_i"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_ey","value":"$[calc::(14+${_i}*44)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(lt::(${_i},${_n}),if::(eq::(${_e.t},1),1,0),0)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"16pt","y":"${_ey}pt+4pt","w":"7pt","h":"7pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"3.5pt","leftB":"3.5pt","rightT":"3.5pt","rightB":"3.5pt"},"bgColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF"},{"type":"txt","x":"36pt","y":"${_ey}pt","w":"{parent.w}-52pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.evRel} v${_e.ver}","fontSize":"12pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[ge::(${_e.g},1)]"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dm","value":"$[parseNumber::(subString::(${_e.d},0,2),0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dy","value":"$[parseNumber::(subString::(${_e.d},3,5),0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dme","value":"$[if::(eq::(${_dm},1),Jan,if::(eq::(${_dm},2),Feb,if::(eq::(${_dm},3),Mar,if::(eq::(${_dm},4),Apr,if::(eq::(${_dm},5),May,if::(eq::(${_dm},6),Jun,if::(eq::(${_dm},7),Jul,if::(eq::(${_dm},8),Aug,if::(eq::(${_dm},9),Sep,if::(eq::(${_dm},10),Oct,if::(eq::(${_dm},11),Nov,if::(eq::(${_dm},12),Dec,--))))))))))))]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dz","value":"${_dm}月${_dy}日"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_de","value":"${_dme} ${_dy}"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dd","value":"$[if::(eq::(length::(${_e.d}),5),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_dz},${_de}),${_e.d})]"}},{"type":"txt","x":"36pt","y":"${_ey}pt+19pt","w":"{parent.w}-52pt","h":"-1","text":"${_dd} · ${@i18n.gap} ${_e.g} ${@i18n.gapD}","fontSize":"10pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(${_e.g},1),0,1)]"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dm","value":"$[parseNumber::(subString::(${_e.d},0,2),0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dy","value":"$[parseNumber::(subString::(${_e.d},3,5),0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dme","value":"$[if::(eq::(${_dm},1),Jan,if::(eq::(${_dm},2),Feb,if::(eq::(${_dm},3),Mar,if::(eq::(${_dm},4),Apr,if::(eq::(${_dm},5),May,if::(eq::(${_dm},6),Jun,if::(eq::(${_dm},7),Jul,if::(eq::(${_dm},8),Aug,if::(eq::(${_dm},9),Sep,if::(eq::(${_dm},10),Oct,if::(eq::(${_dm},11),Nov,if::(eq::(${_dm},12),Dec,--))))))))))))]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dz","value":"${_dm}月${_dy}日"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_de","value":"${_dme} ${_dy}"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dd","value":"$[if::(eq::(length::(${_e.d}),5),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_dz},${_de}),${_e.d})]"}},{"type":"txt","x":"36pt","y":"${_ey}pt+19pt","w":"{parent.w}-52pt","h":"-1","text":"${_dd} · ${@i18n.first}","fontSize":"10pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(lt::(${_i},${_n}),if::(eq::(${_e.t},2),1,0),0)]"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dm","value":"$[parseNumber::(subString::(${_e.d},0,2),0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_dy","value":"$[parseNumber::(subString::(${_e.d},3,5),0)]"}},{"typ